{"ID":"20240220132645-a6blzaq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132645-a6blzaq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132645-a6blzaq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145908-vcbp13x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145908-tebjkv0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145908-tebjkv0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:127,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:127\u0026#125;","title":"【葛芩连汤】（葛根黄芩黄连汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312145908-vcbp13x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-vcbp13x","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-dnlmona","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-dnlmona","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」「桂枝证」,医反下之。利遂不止,脉促,喘而汗出者,表未解也,「葛根黄芩黄连汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-mvsm3b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-mvsm3b1","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根黄芩黄连汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-5z77d72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-5z77d72","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根半斤，甘草二两炙，黄苓三两，黄连三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-7tx7u9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-7tx7u9x","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味,以水八升,先煮葛根,减二升,内诸药,煮取二升,去滓,分温再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-i64dbtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-i64dbtm","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个葛根黄芩黄连汤，我们用的非常广。太阳病有桂枝汤症，就是有汗，恶风，发热，有时头痛，这是太阳病，你用桂枝汤症就可以了，结果你反下之。伤寒论的大原则，表症有的时候，要先发表再攻里。攻里的时候一定要确定他有没有表症。所以我们承气汤，用大黄的时候，一定先问他有没有感冒发烧，摸摸脉，脉浮到的就是有。或者不是医生攻下，吃到坏的食物，下痢。桂枝汤表没有解掉，结果吃到坏死的食物，造成下痢，结果病邪跑到肠胃里面去了。变成脉促，喘而汗出，这个时候用葛根黄芩黄连汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-s8c6cdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-s8c6cdc","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛芩连汤（葛根黄芩黄连汤）是用在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，什么叫热利？肛门痛，便臭，热利。有人会看到血。这是就可以开葛根黄芩黄连汤，这里是告诉你热利的来源，有时候不是这样来的，他吃坏肚子了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145908-tebjkv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145908-tebjkv0","updated":"20240312145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛芩连汤的时候，黄芩黄连剂量是相等的。黄芩跟黄连有点差异，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连仔细看很黄味道很厚很重，是土，黄连是苦味，它清理胃里面的东西，黄芩也是黄，但是带有点绿色，所以肝胆的湿热，小肠的湿热黄芩用的很多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个两个剂量相等。葛根这里是五钱。按比例抓就好了。用汤剂最好。"}]}]}